  "prefLabel": "Rev 1201.07 Homestead",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1201.07 “Homestead” means “homestead” as defined in RSA 198:56, II. The term includes only such land and outbuildings as are identified in the same tax bill.\n\nSource. #7910, eff 6-25-03 ss by #9946, eff 6-23-11 (from Rev 1201.05); ss by #12923, eff 11-26-19",
